sequenceDiagram
    participant Orchestrator
    participant Orders
    participant Payments
    participant Inventory

    Orchestrator->>+Orders: cancel(order 8812)
    Orders-->>-Orchestrator: cancelled
    rect rgb(255, 235, 235)
        Note over Orchestrator,Inventory: Compensating transactions
        par refund the card
            Orchestrator->>+Payments: refund(49.00 EUR)
            Payments-->>-Orchestrator: refunded
        and restock the items
            Orchestrator->>+Inventory: restock(sku A-19, qty 1)
            Inventory-->>-Orchestrator: restocked
        end
    end
    Orchestrator->>Orders: saga complete
